    "title": "AI-equipped before it was a checkbox.",
    "description": "I have treated AI as part of the engineering workflow since GitHub Copilot's technical preview, evolving through Supermaven and Cursor to Claude Code and Codex. The point is not novelty; it is faster feedback, broader context, and more time for product and engineering decisions.",
